{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0293_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f16bf703df166102dad2ab04d3cf4de74f065c10d0e5e118d732621e75d50392", "ja": "（アイドル達が、VRのゲーム内でライブをする事に。\n宣伝のため、瑞希と酒場にやってきた）", "zh": "（偶像们要在VR游戏中举办演唱会。为了宣传，和瑞希来到了酒馆。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0293_1001_p", "source_sha256": "5908b18b1d2fa3b9f845d4025c51ff53d7fd153d08c2b221f9cd2ba81dfdbef1", "ja": "（もちろん俺は、共有アバターを通して\n瑞希にくっついているだけだが……）", "zh": "（当然，我只是通过共享头像贴在瑞希身边而已……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0293_1002_044miz", "source_sha256": "ad1f158f75589b304bda5a6baeaa7a449a170e1139deae4a5170e9c81e079363", "ja": "……というわけで、こちらの店内に、\nポスターを貼らせてもらっても構いませんか？", "zh": "……事情就是这样，请问能不能让我在贵店内\n张贴海报呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0293_1003_masuta", "source_sha256": "04fba99bf48583031e9782f06d0006702d01d5df5da3e2b222084bd63f344e2c", "ja": "いいですけど、冷やかしは困りますよ？", "zh": "可以是可以，但要是来寻开心的可不行哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0293_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "3b19708201a3f5f93466fb6718ed6ccfc69e09de4538449522e6cdd8d5c58291", "ja": "わかっています。へい、マスター、\nこちらの{$P$}に一杯。", "zh": "我明白。来，老板，给这位{$P$}来一杯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0293_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "3e4d0726aff3d9b66680e57285d77ddd018c21f600ccadc219b89a5efd001b55", "ja": "こいつは私からのおごりだぜ、ベイビー。", "zh": "这杯我请，宝贝。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0293_1006_p", "source_sha256": "639129bc2424944eaa432d97ee006709ffb24ea26c17ade4af7f004fe15db348", "ja": "あ、ああ、ありがとう……。\n瑞希、なんかずいぶん慣れてるみたいだな？", "zh": "啊、啊啊，谢谢你……。\n瑞希，你好像已经相当习惯了啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0293_1007_044miz", "source_sha256": "d4b3d738cfe6b34f236a5ff3ea87fe05a917f4d84045cb0f683b0986d8a4491a", "ja": "はい。一度、来たことがありますから。すっかり私も\nハードボイルドです。……ドリンクはノンアルですが。", "zh": "是的。因为我曾经来过一次。我也已经彻底变得硬派了。……不过，饮料是无酒精的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0293_1008_044miz", "source_sha256": "e8ed817b9715572dedca330d02fdb27aec8a1259850181185a5b83347475d3ff", "ja": "ところでポスターですが、店の外にも貼りたいです。\nもう一杯飲んだら、OKにならないかな……。", "zh": "对了，关于海报，我想也贴到店外去。\n再喝一杯的话，会不会就能同意了呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0293_1009_riizentokyaku", "source_sha256": "90ccc42fc6c035d3cc3633fcb6fc3c3e9461db5433cea136d38f3676e01135d2", "ja": "おっ！？　あんたは……！\nお嬢ちゃん、無事だったのか、よかったな！", "zh": "哦！？你是……！\n\n小姑娘，你没事啊，太好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0293_1010_mohikankyaku", "source_sha256": "9454d05be2bc883bf8eaa1b15561b41d8f0b94fb360add62d9d139ef5d332322", "ja": "どうなったのかなって、心配してたんだ。", "zh": "我还担心着，不知道后来怎么样了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0293_1011_044miz", "source_sha256": "acc1cad313ce03d47be951bbe510cc6a9bee5c522e5badfcd13810ad3b1135de", "ja": "はっ。その特徴的な髪型は……。", "zh": "啊。这个很有特点的发型是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0293_1012_p", "source_sha256": "1231ad5a511fcc91111f2f27126c454a292fdeb06a1bffa82bf9d5fd23dbc62a", "ja": "な、なんか、迫力のある人たちだけど……。\n瑞希、ゲームの友達か？", "zh": "看、看起来都是些气势十足的人……。  \n瑞希，是你在游戏里认识的朋友吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0293_1013_044miz", "source_sha256": "b5e630582787498a49fffc3322a7f61d9ff11b8f2ab5c3de9f3c660233533036", "ja": "はい、大変お世話になった方たちです。\nおふたりとも大丈夫でしたか？", "zh": "是的，她们是非常照顾我的人。\n两位都没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0293_1014_mohikankyaku", "source_sha256": "a897a302fe58c16ceee8b64d4ef5c03ab04603a231dad139fbb6e2ec9953fad4", "ja": "ああ、リスポーンしただけだから、問題ねえよ。\nところで、そのポスターは？", "zh": "啊，只是重生了而已，没事。\n话说回来，那张海报是？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0293_1015_044miz", "source_sha256": "af4b7cec393076b45da7a2b7fb7c60ae0e2d1042ac84eb613e22a85223244024", "ja": "ああ、これは……ライブのお知らせです。\n私たちはアイドルで、これからステージをやります。", "zh": "啊，这是……演唱会的通知。\n我们是偶像，接下来要登台演出。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0293_1016_riizentokyaku", "source_sha256": "361eac38e5d9b062bc258df8442a3e1f9108cdb4437aad91d997e4042b574d71", "ja": "ええっ！？　アイドルってマジすか！？　もしかして\n仲間の子も！？　やっぱなー、可愛いハズっすよね～！", "zh": "诶！？偶像居然是真的吗！？难道说\n连伙伴也是！？我就说嘛，肯定很可爱～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0293_1017_044miz", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0293_1018_riizentokyaku", "source_sha256": "685326c12fbc7f8ee815ed1b5418ece2fa6e3e7ce301846f3f073e53cc5e45b4", "ja": "あ、やべ。……コホン、いいじゃねぇか、ライブ。\n面白そうだから、観に行ってやるぜ！　絶対な！", "zh": "啊，糟糕。……咳咳，演唱会不错嘛。\n看起来挺有意思的，我就去看看吧！绝对去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0293_1019_044miz", "source_sha256": "009544612b73b1b65792936f6730b96bc7bf7f36849c17e3729472deb3fa0f80", "ja": "本当ですか？　ありがとうございます。\nたくさん盛り上げてください。ミッション、成功だぞ。", "zh": "真的吗？谢谢您。\n请务必让现场热闹起来。任务，成功啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0293_1020_p", "source_sha256": "20e367051f9599fd43bd8fdf395374803c033283a5b4dc33c9282d1f50c854cd", "ja": "（どんな世界にいても、アイドルは人を引き付ける。\n……よし、この調子でライブを成功させるぞ！）", "zh": "（无论身处怎样的世界，偶像都能吸引人们。\n……好，就照这个势头让演出成功吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
